Configuration Required
Add these to your Vercel environment variables:

UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-region.upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your-upstash-redis-token
Get these from Upstash Console (free tier available).

Graceful Degradation
Rate limiting is optional - if Upstash isn't configured, all requests pass through normally. This ensures your app works in development without Redis